'''Parkour Times''' is a {{Common}} item. It is used to display the best times on Island Parkour, created with {{ID|Parkour Start/End}}s. It will always display the top ten times with your time also included underneath the top 10, even if your name shows up within the top 10. It is sold at {{NPCSprite|Amelia}}.

